From 9b2ee085eedb30a809bc2dd9ac89a7f24f9f2a8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Max Brito <maxbrito.x1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 01:05:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Brood: raise the supply cap, unit pools and selection size

Supply limit 2000 (the original 200). Unit ids keep a 16-bit index (the
original 11 bits, at most 2047 units), so the unit pool holds 10000
units; sprites, images, orders and bullets grow to match. Selections
and control groups hold 200 units (the original 12). from_bw16() reads
the original's 16-bit ids from replay files.
---
 actions.h    | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 bwgame.h     | 28 ++++++++++++++--------------
 game_types.h | 23 +++++++++++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

